    <span class="section-label">Results, in numbers</span>
    <h1>What the work actually <em>measures up to.</em></h1>
    <p>Marketing pages are easy to write, and numbers are rather harder to fake. Below are the metrics behind every site I ship, along with the operational stats for this very site, which is the agency's own. Most of the numbers are auto-derived from the codebase at build time, so they refresh on every deploy.</p>
