    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Performance &amp; quality targets</h2>
    <p>These are not aspirations. They are the bar I hold every site to before launch, and the same numbers you can verify for yourself by pasting any demo URL into the public auditors.</p>

    <div class="proof-grid">
      <a href="https://pagespeed.web.dev/" rel="noopener" class="proof-card">
        <span class="proof-num">{{ results.pageSpeedRange }}</span>
        <strong>Google PageSpeed score</strong>
        <span>Mobile + desktop, every page, every site. Run any demo URL through pagespeed.web.dev to verify.</span>
      </a>
      <div class="proof-card" style="cursor:default">
        <span class="proof-num">{{ results.webVitalsBand }}</span>
        <strong>Core Web Vitals</strong>
        <span>LCP, INP, and CLS all in the green band on every page, served from 300+ Cloudflare edge locations.</span>
      </div>
      <a href="/accessibility/" class="proof-card">
        <span class="proof-num">{{ results.wcagLevel }}</span>
        <strong>Accessibility floor</strong>
        <span>Every site tested with WAVE, Lighthouse, axe DevTools, and a real screen reader before launch.</span>
      </a>
      <div class="proof-card" style="cursor:default">
        <span class="proof-num">{{ results.uptimeTarget }}</span>
        <strong>Uptime target</strong>
        <span>Cloudflare edge + UptimeRobot 1-minute external checks from three regions. SMS alerts before you notice.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

